From db6ce874b63b03e39ade8db973997dbeb490afc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo Lassmann <timolassmann@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:56:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] New module: SAMStat

Parses the JSON report of SAMStat 2.4 and later (samstat --json): general
statistics (reads, MAPQ >= 30, unmapped, N50, mean Q, median identity),
reads per mapping-quality class, read length, mean base quality along the
read, mismatch/insertion/deletion rates along the read and the cumulative
identity distribution.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
